  "description": "CR 603.6c / 603.10a / 700.4: Jackdaw Savior's trigger fires when it or another flying creature alice controls dies, not for her Grizzly Bears, her uncrewed flying Adventurer's Airship or bob's Storm Crow; its target is another creature card in her graveyard whose mana value (CR 202.3) is less than the dying creature's, read at the announcement (CR 601.2c, 603.3d), and it returns to the battlefield (CR 608.2b).",
